{"speciesId":644,"names":{"fr":"Zekrom","es":"Zekrom","en":"Zekrom","ja":"ゼクロム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa queue produit de l’électricité. Il dissimule son corps dans un nuage électrique et plane dans le ciel d’Unys."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon mythique. Il possède dans sa queue un énorme générateur qui produit de l’électricité."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"This Pokémon appears in legends. In its tail, it has a giant generator that creates electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon légendaire assez puissant pour foudroyer le monde entier. Il soutient ceux qui suivent leur Idéal."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon legendario capaz de chamuscar el mundo con sus rayos. Ayuda a quienes persiguen un mundo de ideales."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"稲妻で 世界を 焼きつくせる 伝説の ポケモン。理想の 世界を つくる 人を 補佐する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa queue produit de l’électricité. Il dissimule son corps dans un nuage électrique et plane dans le ciel d’Unys."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Genera electricidad con su cola y, para ocultarse, sobrevuela Teselia envuelto en nubes de rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾で 電気を 作り出す。 全身を 雷雲に 隠して イッシュ地方の 空を 飛ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon légendaire assez puissant pour foudroyer le monde entier. Il soutient ceux qui suivent leur Idéal."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon legendario capaz de chamuscar el mundo con sus rayos. Ayuda a quienes persiguen un mundo de ideales."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"稲妻で 世界を 焼きつくせる 伝説の ポケモン。理想の 世界を つくる 人を 補佐する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa queue produit de l’électricité. Il dissimule son corps dans un nuage électrique et plane dans le ciel d’Unys."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Genera electricidad con su cola y, para ocultarse, sobrevuela Teselia envuelto en nubes de rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"尻尾で 電気を 作り出す。 全身を 雷雲に 隠して イッシュ地方の 空を 飛ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Lorsque sa queue se met à tourner comme un réacteur, il produit des éclairs qui transpercent tout autour de lui."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando el interior de su cola comienza a girar como una turbina, es capaz de descargar rayos que lo destruyen todo a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When the interior part of its tail spins like a motor, Zekrom can generate many bolts of lightning to blast its surroundings."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"しっぽの 内部が モーターのように 回ると 何本もの 稲妻が 発生して 周囲を つらぬく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Selon la légende, lorsque les gens perdent tout sens de ce qui est juste, Zekrom réduit le pays entier en cendres avec de t